.TH PYO3\-INTROSPECTION "1" "July 2026" "" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
.B pyo3\-introspection
\(en introspect a Python cdylib built using PyO3 and generate type stubs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pyo3\-introspection
.I binary
.I python_module
.I stub_path
.SH OPTIONS
.SS "POSITIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.I binary
Path of the binary to introspect.
.TP
.I python_module
Name of the python module to introspect.
.TP
.I stub_path
Path of the directory to write the stub to.
